      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your pain is valid, and it is true that the world can feel incredibly cold and irrelevant when you give so much of yourself to it. However, the feeling of \"nothingness\" is often a shadow that lingers over grief and exhaustion rather than an accurate map of the future. While healing from this kind of betrayal takes a long, non-linear journey, the value of your conscience is not a static object you keep in a safe after the burn; it is a living part of you that can help you rebuild a life on your own terms.",
